WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:05.250
Would you be able to beat them
with your ability, Takatou-kun?

00:05.250 --> 00:07.960
Oh yeah, you've got no reason
to kill them, right?

00:07.960 --> 00:10.000
I feel like that's what you'd say...

00:10.000 --> 00:11.580
Hey, Takatou-kun!

00:14.630 --> 00:16.080
What's wrong?

00:16.250 --> 00:20.830
Well... back when that misasma
was really bad...

00:21.330 --> 00:22.540
Actually...

00:25.630 --> 00:27.830
WHAT?!

01:58.080 --> 02:02.000
<b>"I'm Not So Rude as to Complain After Being Saved"</b>

02:02.170 --> 02:04.460
Let's just hurry
to the bottom of this tower!

02:04.460 --> 02:06.250
Y-yeah, let's do that!

02:07.750 --> 02:09.330
Hey, wait!

02:09.330 --> 02:11.170
Stop right there, Lynel!

02:11.960 --> 02:15.880
<b>Pyromancer who aims to become</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:15.880
<b>a Knight of the Divine King.</b>

02:11.960 --> 02:15.880
<b>Brought Lynel to the trial at the tower.</b>

02:12.500 --> 02:13.960
Frederica-san!

02:13.960 --> 02:15.920
Gimme the stone!

02:16.080 --> 02:18.290
I'm gonna replenish my magic!

02:18.290 --> 02:21.540
The Apology Stones
only work on me, though...

02:18.290 --> 02:21.500
<b>Thoroughly unlucky person</b>

02:18.290 --> 02:21.500
<b>reincarnated into this world.</b>

02:18.290 --> 02:21.500
<b>Uses "Apology Stones" received from a goddess.</b>

02:22.540 --> 02:24.500
Utterly useless!

02:24.500 --> 02:27.670
God, that loser
is always slowing me down...

02:27.670 --> 02:29.790
Shall we head out as well?

02:32.080 --> 02:34.170
We owe our thanks to the people
who went ahead of us.

02:34.170 --> 02:38.250
Looks like the monsters and traps have
been taken care of for the most part.

02:39.000 --> 02:42.880
Just make sure we don't activate
the remaining traps now.

02:42.880 --> 02:43.790
Sure!

02:45.670 --> 02:47.080
Lynel-san!

02:47.080 --> 02:51.040
Sorry. I truly have awful luck...

02:55.250 --> 02:59.000
If this keeps happening,
then why not always have one in hand?

02:59.000 --> 03:00.710
Great idea!

03:00.710 --> 03:04.170
I'll do one better
and attach it to myself!

03:05.170 --> 03:08.080
Now! Let's move forward!

03:08.080 --> 03:09.920
Wait! Something's inside-

03:13.330 --> 03:14.710
Lynel-san!

03:18.670 --> 03:20.000
Lady Teresa!

03:20.000 --> 03:21.460
What is this?!

03:21.460 --> 03:26.420
I'm not fond of that judgy look
you're giving me, Rick-san.

03:26.630 --> 03:29.750
This is how we get points, you know.

03:29.750 --> 03:32.880
Why are you,
as a Knight of the Divine King,

03:32.880 --> 03:34.330
competing in this?

03:34.500 --> 03:37.630
I accidentally killed too many people,

03:38.170 --> 03:43.670
so since I've been stripped of my title
I took the opportunity to try again.

03:43.880 --> 03:46.040
Everyone, get out of here!

03:47.080 --> 03:48.130
We can't!

03:49.250 --> 03:52.290
A thin wire's been strung up
all over the place!

03:52.290 --> 03:55.330
My, you've got good eyes.

03:55.330 --> 03:57.670
I'll keep her at bay!

03:57.670 --> 04:02.380
A swordmaster would never
let trash like you survive!

04:02.670 --> 04:07.080
At the end of the day,
a Knight of the Divine King is strong!

04:07.790 --> 04:12.670
If strength were the only standard,
then you would not have lost your title!

04:13.040 --> 04:14.170
She's strong!

04:14.170 --> 04:18.000
Rick-san is also quite the master,
but this Teresa...

04:18.330 --> 04:20.380
She gets a kick
out of pulling her punches!

04:21.460 --> 04:22.330
Die.

04:26.080 --> 04:27.130
Huh?

04:28.710 --> 04:34.000
Hey, is this Lynel's left hand
with the stone in it?

04:35.920 --> 04:37.080
What?!

04:37.080 --> 04:38.630
Where's Lynel-san?!

04:38.630 --> 04:41.210
Put the stone in the hand I still have...

04:41.210 --> 04:43.380
I knew you were dying somewhere!

04:44.250 --> 04:47.830
Congratulations on reaching
the 98th floor.

04:48.040 --> 04:50.330
The entirety of this floor is a safe zone,

04:50.330 --> 04:53.380
and we have also prepared
some sleeping accomodations.

04:53.630 --> 04:56.880
I think we should go off
and do our own thing now.

04:56.880 --> 04:59.330
We're still fighting
with others here after all.

04:59.540 --> 05:00.790
I agree.

05:00.790 --> 05:03.790
This trial is more rigorous
than I imagined.

05:03.790 --> 05:06.040
However, are you certain you're okay?

05:06.040 --> 05:07.540
We're fine.

05:07.750 --> 05:11.750
Same here, if I wait 'til midnight,
I can replenish my Apology Stones.

05:11.750 --> 05:13.210
Understood.

05:13.210 --> 05:15.920
Well then, I'll go on ahead.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.500
Best of luck.

05:17.670 --> 05:19.170
I'll do the same.

05:19.170 --> 05:21.250
I'd like a room, please.

05:21.250 --> 05:23.170
Right away, sir.

05:23.960 --> 05:25.040
See you!

05:28.750 --> 05:29.960
Wanna rest?

05:31.380 --> 05:35.500
I'm afraid we have
only one room available.

05:36.790 --> 05:38.130
Takatou-kun...

05:38.130 --> 05:41.670
keep in mind, Mokomoko-san
is here with us as well, so...

05:41.670 --> 05:43.330
Don't worry about me.

05:43.330 --> 05:45.500
I'll hide in the wall
and stay out of your hair!

05:45.500 --> 05:47.000
How am I supposed to relax
in here then?!

05:47.000 --> 05:48.250
Uh, Takatou-kun?!

06:05.500 --> 06:07.250
This trial...

06:07.250 --> 06:10.670
I came back from death 15 times,
but I've finally made it...

06:10.670 --> 06:11.920
It's time!

06:14.880 --> 06:18.790
<b>20 Year Anniversary of Service Launch</b>

06:14.880 --> 06:18.790
<b>[UR Guaranteed Gacha]</b>

06:14.880 --> 06:18.790
<b>Happening Now!! (Limit 1 chance)</b>

06:14.880 --> 06:18.790
<b>Notice</b>

06:15.500 --> 06:16.920
100 Apology Stones?!

06:16.920 --> 06:18.830
A guaranteed Ultra Rare gacha?!

06:18.830 --> 06:20.420
All right!

06:21.500 --> 06:23.630
Give it to me!

06:25.290 --> 06:28.170
Will it be a weapon?! Or a partner?!

06:31.250 --> 06:34.250
Wh-what is going on?

06:35.080 --> 06:39.250
You're the goddess that sent me
to this world, aren't you?!

06:39.250 --> 06:42.210
Are you maybe... gonna be my partner?!

06:42.210 --> 06:45.540
Oh, sorry, I'm just here to take a peek
at how you're doing!

06:45.540 --> 06:46.290
What?!

06:46.290 --> 06:49.380
I updated your random walk save point.

06:49.380 --> 06:52.080
Now, no matter how many times you die,
you'll start over from here,

06:52.080 --> 06:53.750
so rest assured!

06:53.750 --> 06:55.790
You've gotta be kidding me!

06:55.790 --> 06:57.960
This place is too dangerous for that!

06:58.710 --> 06:59.960
Bye!

07:06.000 --> 07:07.630
What is this?

07:07.790 --> 07:09.830
Many points of concern have arisen...

07:09.830 --> 07:10.710
Oh?

07:10.920 --> 07:14.630
The number of the deceased does not match
up to the number of souls in the tower.

07:14.630 --> 07:17.880
<b>Swordmaster Urabe</b>

07:14.630 --> 07:17.880
<b>Monitors the seal of the Dark God,</b>

07:14.630 --> 07:17.880
<b>and runs the tower trials.</b>

07:15.170 --> 07:17.920
That isn't something
we need to worry about.

07:17.920 --> 07:21.170
The second barrier can still easily deal
with the necessary amount, right?

07:21.170 --> 07:22.250
Yes.

07:22.250 --> 07:24.630
Also, we will need to replenish
the half-demons

07:24.630 --> 07:26.880
used for the first barrier soon.

07:32.080 --> 07:35.380
It isn't very nice
to attack out of the blue.

07:35.380 --> 07:38.330
You're here to recruit me aren't you?

07:38.710 --> 07:42.210
We were told to kill those who refuse.

07:42.500 --> 07:45.670
I have to make sure I have
the right guy first, so I'll confirm.

07:46.710 --> 07:49.250
You are Rikuto Saitou, right?

07:49.250 --> 07:52.330
A magic eye? How annoying.

07:49.250 --> 07:52.290
<b>Received powers from God and appeared</b>

07:49.250 --> 07:52.290
<b>in this world. Built a colony in the</b>

07:49.250 --> 07:52.290
<b>Forest of Beasts and lives a peaceful life.</b>

07:52.330 --> 07:55.170
Even I can see a name,

07:55.170 --> 07:57.040
Aoi Hayanose!

07:58.830 --> 08:00.580
Tentacles, huh?

08:01.080 --> 08:02.330
Just World!

08:04.250 --> 08:05.750
This is also known as

08:05.750 --> 08:09.170
"A cruel world where
only effort is rewarded."

08:18.580 --> 08:20.880
How can you use the same technique?!

08:21.750 --> 08:24.380
"If you can do it, so can I."

08:24.880 --> 08:27.670
Perhaps you haven't
come to realize that possibility?

08:28.080 --> 08:29.210
Shut up!

08:29.210 --> 08:30.210
Eat this!

08:30.210 --> 08:31.500
Burial Flame!

08:33.580 --> 08:35.170
The hell's happening?!

08:35.170 --> 08:40.580
"The power received from God for free,
may also be taken away at His whim."

08:40.580 --> 08:42.540
Perhaps this is a thing too?

08:43.330 --> 08:46.500
I didn't get THIS from God!

08:47.080 --> 08:52.210
Since that sword has a high luck stat,
I can't interfere using my own ability.

08:56.130 --> 08:56.880
But...

08:57.170 --> 09:00.250
all I have to do is not get hit by it.

09:11.670 --> 09:15.210
What's this? We got a message.

09:15.210 --> 09:17.290
Looks like our next job.

09:18.210 --> 09:23.040
The targets are the sage candidates,
Yogiri Takatou and Tomochika Dannoura.

09:23.040 --> 09:25.330
Head to the city of Hanabusa.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.670
Sage candidates... Seriously?

09:27.670 --> 09:30.000
Do they really need me to handle those?

09:30.330 --> 09:32.500
No time to even catch my breath.

09:32.500 --> 09:36.290
Please wait for me!

09:42.420 --> 09:45.130
I am Daimon Hanakawa!

09:45.130 --> 09:52.040
<b>(Healer)</b>

09:45.130 --> 09:52.040
<b>Specializes in recovery,</b>

09:45.130 --> 09:52.040
<b>unimposing as an adventurer.</b>

09:45.380 --> 09:48.920
As I was roaming around a super dangerous
zone in the Forest of Beasts,

09:48.920 --> 09:52.080
I was taken in by Rikuto
and somehow managed to live,

09:52.080 --> 09:57.630
but since you have killed Rikuto,
there's nothing I can do!

09:57.630 --> 09:58.580
What is this?

09:59.040 --> 10:03.210
I beg you, please make me your servant!

10:03.210 --> 10:04.080
What a funny creature.

10:04.080 --> 10:05.130
Please!
What a funny creature.<b></b>

10:05.130 --> 10:06.040
Please!

10:20.630 --> 10:21.920
Tomochika!

10:21.920 --> 10:23.790
Will you please wake up now?

10:24.420 --> 10:26.880
Boy, this goes for you too...
Please wake up!

10:27.500 --> 10:30.130
What? Morning already?

10:33.040 --> 10:35.040
Huh?!

10:35.540 --> 10:37.330
Hey, Takatou-kun?!

10:38.420 --> 10:40.540
Are you finally awake?! Come over here!

10:40.540 --> 10:41.750
Come on, this way!

10:41.750 --> 10:44.880
Please, help me. I can't move...

10:46.830 --> 10:50.380
Mokomoko-san!
Why are you halfway stuck in the wall?!

10:50.380 --> 10:51.250
Well...

10:51.250 --> 10:53.330
After you two went to bed,

10:53.670 --> 10:56.920
I saw the boy throw his arms
around you half asleep,

10:56.920 --> 10:59.040
and I thought it'd be rude to interrupt,

10:59.040 --> 11:02.210
so I took the hint
and tried to disappear, but...

11:02.210 --> 11:03.130
Right.

11:03.130 --> 11:08.080
I was curious and this is what happened
when I tried to sneakily peep at you.

11:08.080 --> 11:10.040
Couldn't fully commit to peeping, huh?!

11:10.040 --> 11:11.580
It seems as if they're

11:11.580 --> 11:15.210
about to gather all the spirits and souls
of the dead in this tower for some reason,

11:15.210 --> 11:18.790
so there's quite a bit of suction
in the walls and floor.

11:18.790 --> 11:21.420
So you were stuck the whole night?

11:21.420 --> 11:22.460
Yes, correct.

11:23.750 --> 11:25.250
Are you awake, boy?!

11:25.250 --> 11:27.210
Please, will you do something to help me?

11:27.960 --> 11:29.380
Let me see...
Oof, please do something...<b></b>

11:29.380 --> 11:31.290
Maybe I should kill the suction mechanism.
Oof, please do something...<b></b>

11:31.290 --> 11:33.290
Maybe I should kill the suction mechanism.
Ah... I'm being sucked in...<b></b>

11:33.290 --> 11:34.960
Ah! It's sucking me in!

11:34.960 --> 11:36.080
It's sucking me in!

11:37.380 --> 11:39.250
We weren't together for long,

11:39.250 --> 11:40.420
It's sucking me in!
but you've had an unforgettable<b>
</b>impact on me, my dear ancestor.<b></b>

11:40.420 --> 11:42.960
but you've had an unforgettable
impact on me, my dear ancestor.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.540
Don't abandon me so easily!

11:44.790 --> 11:45.630
Wait a second...

11:45.630 --> 11:46.420
Wait a second...
Just need a little help...<b></b>

11:46.420 --> 11:47.790
I'm zoning in on a target...
Just need a little help...<b></b>

11:47.790 --> 11:48.130
I'm zoning in on a target...
Just a little...<b></b>

11:48.130 --> 11:48.830
Just a little...

11:50.710 --> 11:51.670
She flew out!

11:52.250 --> 11:53.630
Looks like it worked.

11:55.130 --> 11:57.130
I thought I was going to die!

11:57.130 --> 11:59.210
You've been dead
for a long time now, though!

12:00.710 --> 12:04.330
But what in the world could they be
gathering souls of the deceased for?!

12:04.330 --> 12:07.920
There's another reason
for this trial, most likely.

12:08.710 --> 12:10.000
Dannoura-san.

12:10.000 --> 12:10.880
Yeah?

12:11.540 --> 12:13.380
I want you to steel yourself.

12:13.830 --> 12:14.830
Huh?

12:15.130 --> 12:17.540
Because I'm going to outright kill anybody

12:17.540 --> 12:19.790
who seems like an enemy
from this point forward.

12:20.080 --> 12:22.500
Hasn't it been like that
since we got here?

12:22.500 --> 12:27.460
Well, I've always done my best
to avoid killing.

12:27.460 --> 12:31.330
But all participants here
are ready and willing.

12:31.330 --> 12:33.080
I can't afford to hesitate.

12:33.080 --> 12:34.540
I'm way ahead of you.

12:34.540 --> 12:36.170
I've already got nerves of steel.

12:37.670 --> 12:43.080
When you use your ability to kill,
I consider it as if I've done it myself.

12:43.540 --> 12:45.920
I've always felt like that.

12:48.330 --> 12:52.750
I'm not so rude as to complain
when you save me... like that.

12:52.750 --> 12:53.750
Yes!

12:53.750 --> 12:56.000
The daughter of a warrior family
is not one to take lightly!

12:56.000 --> 12:57.170
...lightly ...lightly!

12:57.170 --> 13:00.920
Well, I'd say to keep it all
to a minimum, though.

13:05.170 --> 13:07.380
Anyways, I'm hungry.

13:07.790 --> 13:10.290
I fell asleep without
eating anything yesterday.

13:10.290 --> 13:13.790
Oh, right!
Should I give room service a call?

13:14.830 --> 13:15.920
Yeah.

13:23.000 --> 13:25.920
Aoi-sama! Let's run away!

13:26.790 --> 13:28.380
Huh? Why?

13:28.380 --> 13:33.130
Aoi-sama, your power makes
cheat abilities ineffective, correct?!

13:33.130 --> 13:35.670
This means you can't beat a dragon, right?

13:35.670 --> 13:38.460
These kinds of things are simple.

13:40.500 --> 13:43.790
There's no way a creature that huge
can fly, is there?

13:47.670 --> 13:49.130
"Just World" is an ability

13:49.130 --> 13:52.580
that can change a phenomenon
to be just as I believe it to be.

13:52.580 --> 13:54.790
That's like a super cheat!

13:54.790 --> 13:56.460
That isn't quite true.

13:56.460 --> 13:59.330
If my opponent has a high luck stat,
then I can't use it on them.

13:59.330 --> 14:01.210
Oh is that so?

14:01.210 --> 14:03.330
Ah, I wouldn't get close if I were you...

14:05.710 --> 14:07.920
H-heal!

14:09.580 --> 14:11.920
Did you only render it unable to fly?!

14:11.920 --> 14:12.790
Yeah.

14:15.040 --> 14:17.500
All I can do is beat it down, huh?

14:19.670 --> 14:20.880
Huh?

14:25.750 --> 14:28.580
The Aggressor, Hedgehog.

14:30.080 --> 14:32.880
Is it gathering intel?

14:33.250 --> 14:34.420
Uh, Aoi-sama?!

14:34.420 --> 14:35.830
Why are you behind me?!

14:35.830 --> 14:39.790
Since you're so large, I think it's
the perfect place to conceal myself.

14:39.790 --> 14:42.750
How could you insult me so casually?!

14:48.500 --> 14:52.080
We're saved... right?

14:52.080 --> 14:55.500
For a second after that monster left,
I saw a tower.

14:55.500 --> 14:57.960
We may be walking into trouble,
but shall we go there?

14:57.960 --> 15:00.250
There's no need to do that!

15:00.830 --> 15:03.710
I need you to find Yogiri Takatou.

15:03.920 --> 15:07.210
No! I never want to see
Lord Takatou again!

15:07.210 --> 15:10.000
I am positive he'll kill me!

15:10.000 --> 15:13.170
Let me go! Let me go!
Please, Aoi-sama!

15:14.250 --> 15:16.630
We're halfway through now!

15:16.880 --> 15:20.420
Things are going pretty smoothly
for us, huh?

15:20.670 --> 15:23.290
I feel a little sorry for them...

15:23.920 --> 15:26.130
We've gotten all the way here

15:26.130 --> 15:28.420
because I've killed the
tricks and riddles along the way.

15:28.420 --> 15:31.000
Don't you think it's bad to cheat?

15:32.380 --> 15:34.290
Where'd you pop out from?

15:34.290 --> 15:40.170
I am the creator of this tower,
so I can emerge from anywhere.

15:40.330 --> 15:43.170
Isn't that way more unfair
than what we do?!

15:43.170 --> 15:47.130
Do you understand how I feel
as a creator who wracked his brain

15:47.130 --> 15:50.630
to come up with a multitude of riddles
to just have them bypassed?

15:50.630 --> 15:53.710
We just want to leave, though.

15:53.710 --> 15:55.250
You can't do that.

15:55.460 --> 15:56.750
This tower exists

15:56.750 --> 16:01.000
for the sake of maintaining the
barriers that conceal the Dark God.

16:01.000 --> 16:03.210
It would be a problem
if it were destroyed.

16:03.460 --> 16:06.040
If you let us out I won't mess up
anything else.

16:06.040 --> 16:08.830
And you expect me to believe that?

16:08.830 --> 16:13.880
Moreover, what if you were to be used
by the spawn of the Dark God?

16:14.960 --> 16:16.830
You're annoying.

16:17.540 --> 16:21.330
Now then, my name is Eglacia.

16:21.710 --> 16:23.920
People call me the High Wizard.

16:24.580 --> 16:27.000
The choices I am going to give you are-

16:27.000 --> 16:28.080
Die.

16:30.040 --> 16:31.210
Wait, hold on!

16:31.210 --> 16:33.790
He kinda seemed like
he was a VIP here, though?!

16:33.790 --> 16:36.250
He was going to kill us.

16:36.250 --> 16:37.580
Let's get moving.

16:38.170 --> 16:39.130
Yeah...

16:40.290 --> 16:41.830
The division of the mana pathway

16:41.830 --> 16:44.080
and the first barrier around
the tower are unstable,

16:44.080 --> 16:46.170
the door closing mechanism
is malfunctioning,

16:46.170 --> 16:48.670
and the trap devices
are stopping one after another.

16:51.130 --> 16:53.380
Number 97, congratulations.

16:53.380 --> 16:54.540
You have 100 points.

16:57.130 --> 17:00.130
P-please go easy on me!

17:00.130 --> 17:02.170
Those things are an easy win!

17:02.880 --> 17:03.830
Lynel-san!

17:04.380 --> 17:06.290
I met you on the roof.

17:06.290 --> 17:07.290
What's going on?

17:07.290 --> 17:12.000
I'm helping him out since he hasn't
got any points whatsoever.

17:21.040 --> 17:22.960
You've gotten stronger, huh?

17:23.330 --> 17:24.670
Yes...

17:24.670 --> 17:28.080
I've got some decent equipment
from doing 10 gachas straight.

17:29.960 --> 17:31.290
Where are we?

17:32.380 --> 17:33.630
A stadium?!

17:37.920 --> 17:40.000
The swordsmen are fighting each other!

17:42.670 --> 17:44.420
Ouch!

17:44.420 --> 17:47.380
Aiming for the head is mean, you know!

17:48.630 --> 17:50.460
Shiro? You can tell, right?

17:50.460 --> 17:53.710
Her attacks are nothing special.

17:53.710 --> 17:58.460
Maybe even I can beat her,
huh, Masaki-sama?

17:58.790 --> 18:01.420
'Kay, here I go!

18:05.750 --> 18:09.040
Hey! Don't dodge it!

18:09.250 --> 18:11.790
How can she say that when she
swung the sword like an old lady would?

18:11.790 --> 18:15.330
The other person
seems fairly clever, though.

18:15.330 --> 18:16.880
But what will we do?

18:16.880 --> 18:17.500
Huh? What will we do?

18:17.500 --> 18:18.630
That has nothing to do with us,
Huh? What will we do?<b></b>

18:18.630 --> 18:19.580
That has nothing to do with us,

18:19.580 --> 18:22.460
and I'd like to get going now.

18:22.460 --> 18:25.210
Where's the exit for this place?

18:25.540 --> 18:28.080
Can you get serious now?

18:28.460 --> 18:31.630
This isn't the time to use your power
on a disguise, is it?

18:31.830 --> 18:35.580
Since you figured me out,
then there's no point in my holding back.

18:36.210 --> 18:40.170
Wow, you're one
of those half-demons, right?

18:40.170 --> 18:42.210
I'll have you all squared away

18:42.210 --> 18:43.880
before the other swordsmasters
can find me!

18:50.630 --> 18:52.290
No!

19:01.080 --> 19:01.880
Hop!

19:02.170 --> 19:03.380
What?!

19:03.830 --> 19:08.540
You know, I can move much faster
without a sword!

19:10.000 --> 19:12.830
Doesn't seem like this will end
anytime soon.

19:13.210 --> 19:14.420
In that case...

19:14.750 --> 19:19.000
Excuse me, can I get through here please?

19:20.130 --> 19:21.960
Takatou-kun, will you read the room?!

19:21.960 --> 19:24.630
There's a fight to the death
unfolding right now!

19:25.040 --> 19:27.080
What's with you guys?

19:27.080 --> 19:31.290
We're not gonna interfere,
so can we get through here?

19:31.290 --> 19:34.960
Nah, why don't you join us?

19:34.960 --> 19:38.880
My pupils aren't gaining any points.

19:38.880 --> 19:40.790
There's no point in fighting.

19:40.790 --> 19:43.080
The two of us together I believe have...

19:43.080 --> 19:44.580
Six points.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.920
Then you've gotta fight, don't you?

19:46.920 --> 19:49.920
We don't want to get any points.

19:50.540 --> 19:53.790
I'm enjoying this trial like it's a game.

19:54.080 --> 19:56.750
I'm not going to let anybody
just quit the game.

19:57.290 --> 19:58.170
And you?

19:58.170 --> 19:59.330
I...

19:59.330 --> 20:01.960
I don't care what you all do.

20:01.960 --> 20:04.330
I'm already gathering points.

20:04.790 --> 20:07.630
It's perfect if we do
a three-on-three, yeah?

20:07.920 --> 20:11.460
If you beat us, then I'll let you pass.

20:11.920 --> 20:13.670
That rabbit over there is Shiro.

20:13.670 --> 20:16.130
The big one is Geralda.

20:16.130 --> 20:18.580
The pipsqueak is Ema.

20:21.210 --> 20:25.130
I'm having some major doubts in your
bargaining abilities, Takatou-kun!

20:25.130 --> 20:26.630
What is going on here?!

20:26.630 --> 20:27.210
This is crazy, absolutely crazy!

20:27.210 --> 20:29.670
That guy is the type who's too full of
himself to listen to anyone else, huh?
This is crazy, absolutely crazy!<b></b>

20:29.670 --> 20:31.000
That guy is the type who's too full of
himself to listen to anyone else, huh?

20:31.210 --> 20:33.420
You two are having a bad time too, huh?

20:33.420 --> 20:36.580
If the two that will come next
are as good as or better than the rabbit,

20:36.580 --> 20:38.830
I'd say there's little chance of winning.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.130
Ah, right.

20:40.130 --> 20:42.290
Shiro is the weakest one.

20:42.290 --> 20:45.250
She's built like a rock,
but her fighting is amateur.

20:45.250 --> 20:49.170
Ema specializes in sword arts,
and Geralda in magic.

20:49.380 --> 20:53.630
Ah, I'll save the half-demon woman
and that girl for later.

20:53.630 --> 20:56.630
Keep them alive,
regardless of their condition.

20:56.630 --> 20:59.080
Then I'm just going to kill the boy?

20:59.080 --> 21:02.500
I've always thought
that good-looking men should die.

21:02.790 --> 21:04.210
Understood.

21:05.210 --> 21:06.460
Takatou-kun...

21:07.250 --> 21:08.170
Right.

21:08.170 --> 21:09.210
Die.

21:16.420 --> 21:18.920
I can pass now, right?

21:23.000 --> 21:25.170
You think I'd just let you pass?!

21:32.540 --> 21:33.710
Liar.

21:35.080 --> 21:37.540
H-hey, wait right there, please!

21:39.330 --> 21:41.330
You did this?

21:42.210 --> 21:43.290
Yeah, I did.

21:43.580 --> 21:47.170
Then I apologize
for such a rude request...

21:49.290 --> 21:52.420
but will you please help me?

21:52.960 --> 21:53.960
Uh...

21:54.330 --> 21:55.580
What do we do?

21:55.580 --> 21:57.670
Don't make me decide!

21:58.330 --> 22:02.040
Well, we could at least hear her out...

23:36.830 --> 23:40.380
<b>"Standard Opening of Gate Number One Confirmed"</b>

23:37.880 --> 23:40.420
"Standard Opening of
Gate Number One Confirmed"
